 riesgos. No se deben realizar maniobras invasivas, administrar sustancias ni aplicar tratamientos que correspondan al personal de salud. La intervención debe limitarse a las acciones básicas para las cuales se cuenta con preparación."}},{"type":"shape","name":"Rectángulo 456509","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_RECTANGLE","constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":290,"ty":679}}},"id":"4276e7de-510e-45de-a9b4-8190c7ac6e78","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":1627,"ty":-11021},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":221,"g":238,"b":254}}},"stroke":{"type":"none","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":112,"g":112,"b":112}},"width":1,"align":"inside"}},"shape":{"type":"rect","x":0,"y":0,"width":1020,"height":180}},{"type":"text","name":"Una niña introduce una semilla o un objeto pequeño en la nariz mientras juega. \nUn niño presenta inflamación y dificultad respiratoria después de la picadura de un insecto. \nUna niña desarrolla una convulsión asociada con fiebre alta. \nUn niño ingiere acci","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":345,"ty":706}}},"id":"169df9cd-194a-4bc6-97c7-667b8f5430a0","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":1682,"ty":-10994},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":34.5}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":935},"parag